# Allowlist: Docker builds only see what the images are built from (deploy/docker/Dockerfile).
# Everything else (.git, .cluster/.demo recordings, node_modules, test output) stays out, so a
# build sends a few MB instead of gigabytes. Add a path here when the Dockerfile needs it.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!pkg
!gen
!sdk/js
!examples/web-demo
!deploy/docker/certs
**/node_modules
cmd/tessera-loadtest/tessera-loadtest
sdk/js/dist
sdk/js/test-results
sdk/js/playwright-report
examples/web-demo/dist
